The pricing math reproduces the on-chain behaviour of the following programs.
Account layouts, fee formulas and rounding rules were read from their public
source code and confirmed against mainnet simulation. Their authors are
credited here; check each repository for its current license terms.

  Raydium CLMM      https://github.com/raydium-io/raydium-clmm
  Raydium CP Swap   https://github.com/raydium-io/raydium-cp-swap
  Raydium AMM (v4)  https://github.com/raydium-io/raydium-amm
  Orca Whirlpools   https://github.com/orca-so/whirlpools
  Meteora DLMM      https://github.com/MeteoraAg/dlmm-sdk
  Meteora DAMM v2   https://github.com/MeteoraAg/damm-v2-sdk

Runtime dependencies (installed by npm, not redistributed here):

  @solana/web3.js            MIT
  @pump-fun/pump-swap-sdk    MIT          PumpSwap quote math and instructions
  @meteora-ag/cp-amm-sdk     (see package) DAMM v2 quote math and instructions
  bn.js                      MIT
